volatility3 pdbconv (PR #650, 7fe200e5f4611a676299dd67fd435a8dd9bec6e7): PDBs it could not convert.

- LF_VFTABLE records are skipped like the other method-list records.
- LF_QUADWORD and LF_UQUADWORD values (64-bit enum constants) are read.
- An unexpected value type names itself, its record and its offset.

Made on Dom0 on 2026-11-15 for windows-symbol-profiles.py clrjit-core32
(.NET 8's 32-bit clrjit.pdb), which stopped at "Unexpected extended value
type". Applied by `make sandboxd` after it switches the checkout.

diff --git a/volatility3/framework/symbols/windows/pdbconv.py b/volatility3/framework/symbols/windows/pdbconv.py
